# Sequence Diagram — Physics Lab S21 Key Operations

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant RG as RightPanel
    participant EBG as ExportButtonGroup
    participant RM as report.ts (主入口)
    participant PDF as pdf.ts
    participant CSV as csv.ts
    participant SS as screenshot.ts
    participant Store as useSimulation Store
    participant DP as DataPanel

    %% ========== PDF Export Flow ==========
    Note over User,PDF: === P0: PDF 导出操作 ===

    User->>EBG: 点击 [PDF 导出] 按钮
    EBG->>RG: setExporting(true)
    EBG->>RM: exportToPDF({ data: reportData })

    RM->>RM: generateMarkdownReport(data)
    RM-->>EBG: markdown: string

    RM->>RM: generateHTMLReport(markdown)
    RM-->>EBG: html: string

    RM->>SS: captureScreenshot()
    SS->>SS: findCanvas() → data-canvas="scene-3d"
    alt Canvas found
        SS-->>RM: { success: true, dataUrl }
    else Fallback to broad selector
        SS-->>RM: { success: true, dataUrl } + warn log
    else No canvas
        SS-->>RM: { success: null, error: NO_CANVAS_FOUND }
    end

    RM->>PDF: exportToPDF({ data, includeScreenshot })
    PDF->>PDF: new jsPDF()
    PDF->>PDF: loadChineseFont(doc)
    alt Font loaded
        PDF->>PDF: buildTextModePDF(doc, true, data, screenshot)
        PDF-->>RM: { success: true, mode: 'text' }
    else Font unavailable
        PDF->>PDF: html2canvas(htmlElement)
        PDF->>PDF: addImagePages(doc, imgData, w, h)
        PDF-->>RM: { success: true, mode: 'image' }
    end

    RM->>RM: downloadFile(blob, 'report.pdf')
    RM-->>User: 触发 .pdf 文件下载
    EBG->>RG: setExporting(false)

    %% ========== CSV Export Flow ==========
    Note over User,CSV: === P0/P1: CSV 导出操作（从 DataPanel 或按钮组）===

    User->>DP: 点击 [导出CSV]
    DP->>Store: 读取 frameCache
    Store-->>DP: CachedFrame[]
    DP->>Store: 读取 physicsParams { mass, gravity }
    Store-->>DP: physicsParams
    DP->>Store: 读取 phases[]
    Store-->>DP: phases[]

    DP->>CSV: downloadCSV({ frames, physicsParams, phaseNames })
    CSV->>CSV: framesToCSVRows(frames, params, phaseNames, interval=10)
    loop 每一帧
        CSV->>CSV: computeEnergies(frame, mass, gravity, groundY)
        Note right of CSV: KE = 0.5 * m * v²<br/>PE = m * g * h<br/>E_total = KE + PE
    end
    CSV-->>CSV: CSVRow[]

    CSV->>CSV: generateCSVContent(rows, addBOM=true)
    Note right of CSV: 添加 UTF-8 BOM \xEF\xBB\xBF<br/>+ Header 行<br>+ 数据行
    CSV-->>CSV: csvString with BOM

    CSV->>CSV: downloadFile(csvBlob, filename.csv)
    CSV-->>User: 触发 .csv 文件下载

    %% ========== Markdown Export Flow (Existing, Unchanged) ==========
    Note over User,RM: === P0: Markdown 导出操作（已有功能，不变）===

    User->>EBG: 点击 [Markdown 导出]
    EBG->>RM: downloadReport(data, 'markdown')
    RM->>RM: generateMarkdownReport(data)
    RM->>RM: generateHTMLReport(md) — 仅用于内部转换
    RM->>RM: downloadFile(mdContent, 'report.md', 'text/markdown')
    RM-->>User: 触发 .md 文件下载

    %% ========== Screenshot-Only Flow ==========
    Note over User,SS: === P0: 单独截图操作 ===

    User->>EBG: 点击 [截图]
    EBG->>SS: captureScreenshot()
    SS->>SS: querySelector([data-canvas="scene-3d"] canvas)
    SS->>SS: canvas.toDataURL('image/png')
    SS-->>EBG: CaptureResult

    alt Success
        EBG->>EBG: downloadFile(dataUrl, 'screenshot.png')
        EBG-->>User: 触发 PNG 下载
    else Failed
        EBG->>User: Toast 提示 "截图失败"
    end

    %% ========== DataPanel Render Flow (Enhanced) ==========
    Note over User,DP: === P1: 数据面板渲染流程（增强后）===

    User->>Store: 播放动画 / 停在某一帧
    Store-->>DP: currentTime 更新
    Store-->>DP: frameCache[] 不变

    DP->>DP: enrichFrames(sampledFrames)
    loop 每一行
        DP->>DP: computeKE(frame, mass)
        DP->>DP: computePE(frame, mass, gravity, groundY)
        DP->>DP: phaseNames[frame.phaseId]
    end

    DP->>DP: renderTableView(enrichedRows)
    Note right of DP: 渲染 8 列表格:<br/>t | y | v | a | KE | PE | E | Phase<br/>当前行蓝色高亮 (动态容差)

    DP->>DP: renderLiveView(currentFrame)
    Note right of DP: Live 视图底部显示:<br/>KE: xx J | PE: xx J | E: xx J

    %% ========== Test Execution Flow ==========
    Note over User,Store: === P2: 测试执行流程（Vitest）===

    participant VT as Vitest Runner
    participant TR as report.test.ts
    participant TS as store.test.ts
    participant TP as parser.test.ts
    participant TD as DataPanel.test.tsx

    User->>VT: npm run test
    VT->>VT: 加载 vitest.config.ts
    VT->>VT: 初始化 jsdom environment

    VT->>TR: 执行 report.test.ts
    TR->>RM: generateMarkdownReport(mockData)
    RM-->>TR: markdown string
    TR->>TR: assert 包含 expected content ✅

    VT->>TS: 执行 experiment.store.test.ts
    TS->>Store: buildFrameCache(mockParams) [mocked]
    Store-->>TS: CachedFrame[]
    TS->>TS: assert 帧数和数值正确 ✅

    VT->>TP: 执行 rule-parser.test.ts
    TP->>TP: detectMotion("一个物体从10米高处自由下落")
    TP->>TP: assert returns 'free_fall' ✅

    VT->>TD: 执行 DataPanel.test.tsx
    TD->>@testing-library/react: render(<DataPanel />)
    TD->>TD: assert table has 8 columns ✅
    TD->>TD: assert energy cells not NaN ✅

    VT-->>User: All tests passed! (20+ cases, coverage ≥60%)
